            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">persist-credentials: false</code> to all <code class=\"notranslate\">actions/checkout</code> workflow steps.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Applies security best practices. It prevents persistance of the <code class=\"notranslate\">GITHUB_TOKEN</code> in the local git config.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3494637317\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/883\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/fred/issues/883/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/883\">mdn/fred#883</a>.</p>",
